# Windows "downloaded from the internet" marker (NTFS alternate data stream) —
# shows up as its own file over the WSL/drvfs bridge, e.g.
# "somefile.md:Zone.Identifier" (real colon) or "somefile.md：Zone.Identifier"
# (fullwidth colon substitute WSL uses for ':' in a filename).
*Zone.Identifier*
